OL,3,AbA Scale of cyber-security flaw
OL,4,A'unprecedented' but no sign of
OL,5,Abreaches, says expert
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe scale of cyber-security flaw
OL,8,Faffecting millions of websites is
OL,9,F"unprecedented", one expert says, but
OL,10,Fthere is so far no sign of breaches
OL,12,FOlly Whitehouse, the chief technology
OL,13,Fofficer for the UK's National Cyber
OL,14,FSecurity Centre (NCSC), says the
OL,15,Fproblem will be "universally felt"
OL,17,FThe vulnerability is within the PHP
OL,18,Fprogramming language, which collects
OL,19,Finformation you need and presents it in
OL,20,Fa way you can read on the web. Here's a
OL,21,Ftimeline of how the saga unfolded
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
