OL,3,AbA Scale of cyber-security flaw
OL,4,A'unprecedented' but no sign of
OL,5,Abreaches, says expert
OL,6,
OL,7,FAround the world, organisations are
OL,8,Fscrambling to fix the security flaw -
OL,9,Four cyber correspondent explains how AI
OL,10,Fwas used to find the problem
OL,12,FIn the UK, a minister says 32
OL,13,Fgovernment services are unavailable and
OL,14,Ffour partially unavailable as problems
OL,15,Fare fixed
OL,17,FInternet infrastructure platform
OL,18,FCloudflare says it saw "millions" of
OL,19,Fhacking attempts on its network - but
OL,20,Fthere's no evidence that these were
OL,21,Fsuccessful
